Featuring a striking deep metallic blue and silver paint scheme, "Blue Steel" shared the aggressive, angular plate design and extended shoulder pads of the Centurion line. Tony engineered this suit to test retractable forearm wrist blades, reinforced kinetic armor lining, and an enhanced Unibeam lens capable of focusing energy blasts into slicing focal points.

In Iron Man 3, Mark XXX joins the House Party Protocol at the Norco oil rig, slicing through Extremis forces in aerial combat before being destroyed in the final "Clean Slate" detonation order.
